sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor OP as Platform
    participant GH as GitHub Actions
    participant CS as Cloud SQL
    participant SQ as SonarQube

    OP->>GH: PR new image_digest
    GH->>GH: preview + G0–G3
    OP->>CS: gcloud sql backups create (pre-upgrade-<version>)
    CS-->>OP: operation DONE · backup id
    OP->>GH: merge
    GH->>SQ: helm_release app (atomic)
    SQ->>CS: startup · DB migration via Auth Proxy
    alt migration and startup succeed
        SQ-->>GH: ready · status UP
    else fails before migrating
        GH->>SQ: atomic reverts to the previous image
    else fails after migrating
        Note over SQ: no image rollback (DG §6)
        OP->>SQ: scale to 0 replicas
        OP->>CS: gcloud sql backups restore (id from step 3) · in place
        CS-->>OP: instance restored · same name
        OP->>GH: PR with the previous digest
    end
